    "turns": [
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "为什么「Boosting 提升法」会成为人工智能史上值得单独记住的一步？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-hook"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "学习理论提出：一个只比随机猜测略好的学习过程，能否被转化为高精度学习器。Schapire 在 Boosting 框架下证明了弱可学习与强可学习的等价性。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-1990-boosting-primary", "source-benchcouncil-ai100-catalog"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-1990-boosting-membership", "claim-1990-boosting-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "Boosting 在重新加权或重采样的数据上反复调用弱学习器，并组合得到的多个假设。后续轮次重点关注此前假设处理不好的样本。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-1990-boosting-primary"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-1990-boosting-membership", "claim-1990-boosting-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "专家通常把“由弱变强”的结果视为 Boosting 的理论基础。它开启了重要的集成学习路线，后来发展出 AdaBoost、梯度提升、XGBoost 和 LightGBM。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-1990-boosting-primary", "source-1990-boosting-secondary"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-1990-boosting-membership", "claim-1990-boosting-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "当今天的系统规模越来越大时，「Boosting 提升法」留下的思路还有哪些价值，又有哪些边界值得重新追问？",
